    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは良かった！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これでまた１歩『W.I.N.G.』に近づいたな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、少しずつ前に進んでいるのが\r\n実感できるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……とはいえ\r\nここからはもっと厳しくなるだろうね",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな……\r\n他のアイドル達のレベルも、どんどん上がっていくだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "次の審査も通過して、\r\nファンに笑顔を届けたいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "さっそくレッスンをするよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫か？\r\n無理はしないようにするんだぞ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ。大丈夫だよ\r\nプロデューサーは心配性だな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶は誰かのためとなると\r\nすぐにがんばりすぎてしまうからな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間のファンレターの件だって……\r\n本当に心配したんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あの件はすまなかったね\r\n多少無理をしてしまうのは性分のようだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこまで熱心なのはうれしいが……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "特に今は大事な時期だ\r\n手加減なしでやっていきたいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "後悔だけはしたくないからね",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n咲耶の想いはよくわかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでも無茶をしすぎてるようなら止めるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、わかった\r\nそうやってサポートしてくれるのはありがたいよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700600103/7006001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、一緒に頑張って行くぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7006001030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "よろしく頼むよ、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
